{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:11 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:11 2026-10-19 HKT</p><p>尖沙咀梳士巴利道10號香港文化中心，今（19日）早上11時25分，中心主劇場後台疑出現電力故障後發生火警，一名女職員救火時遭燒傷臉及手部，救護員為她鋪上降溫敷料，清醒被送院救治，消防到場時發現火勢已經熄滅，消防人員遂開喉戒備。據悉，傷者因發生觸電意外而受傷。</p><img alt=\"女傷者臉上鋪有降溫敷料。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7d8ab3c0b1fdab6688ab69015ad9d77/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_02_40_8_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c347a95db9c95ddc49a17e4915189606/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_02_40_7_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女職員清醒送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c62915a6743d2fc77df62114a26b4281/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_02_40_6_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd3c573260f07864f962f2badf731b04/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_02_40_5_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"一名女子陪同傷者送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc88cee47c205c4f0ba0d8fb82c5b6ab/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_02_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救熄火警。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e93b79bc4a4a7336d57e16212c87f48/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_31_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b579026a5b40be98e9fd8f2073dc0ab9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_31_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救熄火警。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bfc810ab41bdcd4a5f4351cf0a45fb3a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_31_35_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"香港文化中心發生火警。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/beac990ae921fa7c34973fd59b840cf5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-19_at_12_31_35.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:38:46.572991+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:11:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T06:37:48.562161+00:0